                "questionHindi": "क्या मैं मदुरै, पुणे या अहमदाबाद से दिल्ली–आगरा–जयपुर टूर में शामिल हो सकता/सकती हूँ?",
                "answer": "Yes. Many travelers book international or domestic flights to Delhi first. If you're coming from Madurai, Pune, or Ahmedabad, you can fly or take a train to New Delhi and we'll start the tour there. Alternatively, we can arrange private transfer or local flight connections from Mumbai/Bengaluru to reach Delhi.",
